const faqs = [
  {
    q: "How is outstation distance and billing calculated?",
    a: "Outstation round-trips follow a standard minimum of 250 km per calendar day (300 km for Tempo Traveller). Kilometers are calculated garage-to-garage from Chennai. If you travel 210 km, the minimum 250 km applies; if you travel 330 km, you pay for the exact 330 km."
  },
  {
    q: "Are highway tolls, parking fees, and driver bata included in the per-km rate?",
    a: "Our per-km rate includes the vehicle, clean AC, and fuel. Driver bata is charged per calendar day as indicated in the tariff card. FASTag highway tolls, parking fees, and interstate permit taxes (if crossing state borders into Karnataka, Andhra Pradesh, or Puducherry) are billed at actuals with zero markup."
  },
  {
    q: "Can we make spontaneous sightseeing or cafe stops on the way?",
    a: "Yes! Our drivers are courteous and flexible. You can request breakfast halts on the highway, scenic photo stops along the East Coast Road, or temple darshan detours at your convenience with zero hesitation."
  },
  {
    q: "Do you provide one-way drop outstation taxi service?",
    a: "Yes! We provide one-way drop taxis from Chennai to Bangalore, Pondicherry, Tirupati, Vellore, Trichy, and Madurai with fixed drop pricing and zero return kilometer charges."
  },
  {
    q: "Is an advance deposit required to confirm an outstation cab?",
    a: "Yes, we collect a nominal advance deposit of ₹500 upon booking confirmation to lock in your designated vehicle and chauffeur. This ₹500 is 100% adjusted against your final invoice, and the remaining balance is paid after trip completion. Cancellations made at least 6 hours before pickup receive a full refund."
  },
  {
    q: "Are your drivers trained for nighttime and hill highway driving?",
    a: "All Kalidass Travels highway chauffeurs have a minimum of 7+ years of interstate experience, strictly adhere to an 80–90 km/h cruising limit, and have specialized expertise on Ghat mountain roads (Tirumala hills, Yelagiri, Yercaud, and Kodaikanal)."
  },
  {
    q: "Do you provide itemized GST tax invoices for company travel reimbursement?",
    a: "Yes. Kalidass Travels (GSTIN: 33COVPM0531D1Z4) provides 100% itemized GST tax invoices with your company name and GSTIN, making corporate expense claims and input tax credit claims seamless."
  }
];

